  "policy_notes": [
    "Mystic Misdirection uses the original live minion attack window, captured physical target and complete DBF796 Sheep. Transform preserves original board residence and the attack continues using current stats.",
    "Untimely Death matches an actual friendly minion death to that physical minion latest successful entry and paid manual minion play on the preceding global turn. Summons, copies, reborn and later replayed/recruited entries do not borrow an older play.",
    "The recorded death face is resummoned at its original position via shared attributed resurrection and summon quantity entry. Printed effects return, ordinary buffs, damage and silence do not.",
    "Default opponent-turn and board-space checks are shared. Exact turn/play meaning, transformed/stolen material, capacity and ordering remain local policies awaiting CN calibration."
  ],
